     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h4>Working in a third-generation, family-owned business:</h4> <p>ZOLLER is a family-run company that develops and produces innovative tool presetting and measuring machines, software for measuring, inspecting and managing cutting tools and automation solutions for the manufacturing floor. </p> <p>With technological innovation, a dedication to high quality, and an active service philosophy, we have secured ourselves as a leader in the industry. We owe our success to the approximately 800 employees at 85 locations worldwide, including our ZOLLER, Inc. headquarters in Ann Arbor, Michigan.</p> <h4>Exciting opportunities for growth:</h4> <p>When you work at ZOLLER, you'll take on a variety of challenging (and often exciting!) tasks, with short decision-making paths and opportunities to help shape and develop your career. Whether you are just starting out or an experienced professional, you can become part of the ZOLLER team.</p> <h4>International environment:</h4> <p>At ZOLLER, practiced customer proximity is not just a promise, but a reality: we have a local sales and service presence in 62 countries. Our team has a diverse variety of skills, ideas, cultures, and languages that add value to our corporate culture.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://secure4.entertimeonline.com/ta/6149610.careers?CareersSearch=&amp;lang=en-US\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Explore current openings</a></p>",
